# Glorious End answers Bot2's Lightning Bolt on Bot2's turn 2: the turn ends (CR 724.1), the Bolt is exiled with Glorious
# End (724.1b), and Bot1 stays at 20. The spell's next instruction still happens after it has left the stack: "at the
# beginning of your next end step, you lose the game" is set up for Bot1, whose next end step is on its own turn 3. Bot1
# is still in the game in that turn's second main phase, and loses as its end step begins (CR 603.7, 104.3e).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Glorious End
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glorious End.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Result = InProgress
? Bot1.Life = 20
? Exile = Lightning Bolt; Glorious End
[T3 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Status = Lost
